# The failures of .dev/validate/defaults.sh the tree still carries, one line each.
#
#   kind ~ key ~ reason
#
# Read by .dev/validate/defaults.sh. A failure with no line fails the band, and a line whose failure no longer
# occurs fails it just as loudly: the row it holds was repaired, so the line goes. No wildcards. The file empties
# as the open rows are repaired; a line left at the freeze is a decision the owner took, with its reason.

row ~ application.service.builtAtBootFailed ~ M-6: one ignore key for both process shapes, the cli keys retired (C6)
row ~ http.session.unboundedTtlOnBoundedDefaultStorage ~ M-6: one ignore key for both process shapes, the cli keys retired (C6)
row ~ http.static.cacheMaxAgeIgnored ~ M-6: one ignore key for both process shapes, the cli keys retired (C6)
row ~ integrations/amqp/v4.TransportConfig ~ S-C-SEC-2 Q-5: DeadLetterMaxLength and DeadLetterTtl on the .dlq queue (C8)
row ~ integrations/amqp/v4.maxDelayBuckets ~ class K: the reason row of the delay buckets, no field (C4)
row ~ integrations/bunorm/migrate/v4.printAppliedGroup ~ W-9: db:migrate refuses while a ran-but-not-recorded marker stands, door --force (C8)
row ~ integrations/bunorm/v4.SplitterConfig ~ M-13: SplitterConfig.PrimaryFallbackDisabled (C8)
row ~ integrations/bunorm/v4/audit.FileStorage.Save#1 ~ H-5: a FileMode field per writer, the audit file storage with the other writers (C5)
row ~ integrations/bunorm/v4/audit.RegistryConfig ~ class R: RegistryConfig.EncryptedColumnsUnmasked, per registry (C3, Q-G5-8)
row ~ integrations/cron/v4.GenerateCommand.writeDestinations#1 ~ H-5: a DirectoryMode field per writer, the cron generator with the other writers (C5)
row ~ integrations/cron/v4.RunnerCommand.Run ~ W-3: a cron User under the in-process runner refused, door RunnerConfig.EntryUserIgnored (C8)
row ~ integrations/cron/v4.TickDedupConfig ~ Q-2 / G3R-3: the dedup over a locker without a lease is an open decision of the owner
row ~ integrations/cron/v4.createTheLogsRoot#1 ~ H-5: a DirectoryMode field per writer, the cron logs root with the other writers (C5)
row ~ integrations/cron/v4.resolveEntryLogPath#1 ~ H-5: a DirectoryMode field per writer, the cron logs root with the other writers (C5)
row ~ security.csrfDisabledOnLoginFirewall ~ M-6: one ignore key for both process shapes, the cli keys retired (C6)
row ~ v4/application.Application.bootCli ~ M-7: ApplicationConfig.DebugCommandsEnabled (C6)
row ~ v4/application.cacheDirectoryMode ~ Q-G5-5: MELODY_CACHE_DIRECTORY_MODE, default 0750 (C5)
row ~ v4/cache.renderedCacheKey ~ class K: the reason row of the rendered key cut, no field (C4)
row ~ v4/cli.cliErrorLineCauseChainDepth ~ class K: cli.RootConfig.ErrorCauseChainDepth (C4)
row ~ v4/config.kernelConfiguration.validateEnvironment ~ H-7: the reason of the closed MELODY_ENV list in CONFIG.md (C9)
row ~ v4/container.closeFailureStackLimit ~ class K: ContainerConfig.CloseFailureStackBytes (C4)
row ~ v4/container.teardownWalkDepthLimit ~ class K: ContainerConfig.TeardownWalk.Depth (C4)
row ~ v4/container.teardownWalkElementLimit ~ class K: ContainerConfig.TeardownWalk.Elements (C4)
row ~ v4/container.teardownWalkNodeBudget ~ class K: ContainerConfig.TeardownWalk.Nodes (C4)
row ~ v4/debug.ParameterCommand.Flags ~ class R: debug:parameters --reveal, refused outside development (C3)
row ~ v4/debug.errorCauseChainDepth ~ class K: the reason row of the debug cause chain, no field (C4)
row ~ v4/http.RegisterKernelTerminateAccessLogListener ~ M-8: ApplicationConfig.AccessLog with Disabled and MaxFieldBytes, the HTTP.md access log section (C6)
row ~ v4/http.sessionCookie ~ M-5: the reason of HttpOnly and of Cache-Control private (C9)
row ~ v4/http/cors.NewService ~ W-14: a scheme-less origin refused credentialed or not, door cors.Config.SchemelessOriginsAdmitted (C7)
row ~ v4/internal.BootWarningNameEnvironmentUndeclaredKey ~ W-2: an undeclared MELODY_ key refuses the boot, door = declare it (C7)
row ~ v4/internal.BootWarningNameSecretMarkUnmatched ~ W-1: an unmatched secret mark refuses the boot, door MarkParameterSecretOptional (C7)
row ~ v4/internal.maxDiagnosticTextLength ~ class K: the diagnostic text length as a field, with the application doors (C4)
row ~ v4/lock.defaultSessionProbeInterval ~ class K: ExclusiveConfig.ProbeInterval (C4)
row ~ v4/logging ~ class R: the redaction and escaping exemption written once in LOGGING.md (C3)
row ~ v4/openapi.maximumSchemaDepth ~ class K: the openapi descent depth as a field (C4)
row ~ v4/security.JwtAlgorithmHs256 ~ M-12: the reason of HS256 only next to the check (C9)
row ~ v4/security/accesscontrol.Control.MatchRuleIndex ~ W-8: a control without a fallback rule refused at compile, door = an explicit rule on / (C7)
row ~ v4/security/config.LoginConfig.Limiter ~ W-7: a login door without a limiter refused at AddFirewall, door LoginConfig.LimiterDisabled (C7)
row ~ v4/session.newFileStorageFromPath#1 ~ H-5 / Q-G5-4: FileStorageConfig.DirectoryMode, default 0700 (C5)
row ~ v4/session.openSessionJournal#1 ~ H-5: FileStorageConfig.FileMode (C5)
row ~ v4/session.writeSessionBytesAtomically#1 ~ H-5 / Q-G5-4: FileStorageConfig.DirectoryMode, default 0700 (C5)
row ~ v4/storage.LocalStorage.Put#1 ~ H-5: LocalStorageConfig.DirectoryMode (C5)
row ~ v4/storage.LocalStorage.Put#2 ~ H-5: LocalStorageConfig.DirectoryMode (C5)
row ~ v4/storage.NewLocalStorage#1 ~ H-5: LocalStorageConfig.DirectoryMode (C5)
row ~ v4/storage.createStorageTemporaryFile#1 ~ H-5: LocalStorageConfig.FileMode (C5)
row ~ v4/translation.maxInterpolationDepth ~ class K: the reason row of the interpolation cycle guard, no field (C4)
